# gh #51 (docs/20 U26) regression: G0 slips mid-sentence. Before the fix the memo ended the
# moment G0 read up once (a memo ended and the next began 0.82 s later). Now a let-go G0
# records on through a 0.6 s grace and the page says so; pressed again inside it, it is
# the same memo (one Start, one file); only a grace that runs out ends it, saved.
# The grace counts toward rec_min_ms: a hold let go 0.2 s after ● REC is still too short.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1000
down g0
wait 600
mic 2500 speech
shot held  按住 G0 说：语音便条，提示栏"G0 松开结束"
up g0
mic 200 speech
shot slipped  松开 0.2 秒：还在录，黄色胶囊"松开了 · 0.6 秒内按回继续"
down g0
mic 2000 speech
shot pressed-again  按回来了：同一条便条接着录，计时没断
up g0
wait 400
shot grace-again  又松开 0.4 秒：还在宽限里
wait 300
shot ended  0.6 秒没按回：结束，"录音已保存 · 0:05"
wait 2600
shot home  回到主页：录1，只有一条
# a short hold: 0.7 s in all, the grace and all under 1 s of audio
hold g0 700
wait 900
shot short  按住 0.7 秒就松开：宽限过后"录音太短，已丢弃"
wait 2600
